      "writtenOn": "2018-09-11T16:13:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, the value if select-\u003epcrSelect is changed if there are too many PCR indexes requested in selection. So, I\u0027m comparing with the value from selection that we have after PCRRead.",
